; ------------------- 82571 / 82572 / 82573 / 82574 family ----------------
; PCIe Gigabit NICs that the e1000e driver supports. Added to the e1000e
; variant on the dev-nt6-1 branch so PnP binds for QEMU's -device e1000e
; (which emulates the 82574L, PCI ID 8086:10D3).
%IntelE1000E_105E.DeviceDesc% = E1000_Inst.ndi,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_105E
%IntelE1000E_108B.DeviceDesc% = E1000_Inst.ndi,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_108B
